      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-346461",
      ":question/problem": "The table below gives the carbon dioxide emission rate $r(t)$, in tons per day, from a factory.\n\n| $t\\,\\text{(days)}$ | $0$ | $2$ | $6$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $r(t)\\,\\text{(tons/day)}$ | $1.5$ | $2$ | $1$ |\n\nUse the right Riemann sum over $[0,6]$ with two subintervals to approximate the total carbon dioxide emitted (in tons).\n\nThe total carbon dioxide emitted is\n{{field-1}} tons."
